---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Baldur's Gate 3 — Which Edition Should You Buy?"
  description="A buying guide for Baldur's Gate 3: edition differences, DLC status, platform performance, and where to buy cheapest in 2026."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Baldur's Gate 3 — Which Edition Should You Buy?</h1>
    <p class="meta">Cross-platform · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Baldur's Gate 3</strong> is the 2023 Game of the Year RPG from Larian
      Studios — a massive, branching Dungeons & Dragons adaptation with deep
      tactical combat and near-limitless player choice.
    </p>

    <h2>Editions explained</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the entire main game; there is no paid story DLC</li>
      <li><strong>Deluxe / Collector's</strong> — art book, soundtrack, and cosmetic DLC; no gameplay advantage</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Importantly, BG3 has no paywalled expansions — the Standard edition is the
      complete experience. The Deluxe extras are for collectors only.
    </p>

    <h2>Platform choice</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>PC</strong> — best for mods and the tactical camera</li>
      <li><strong>PS5</strong> — excellent console port with split-screen co-op</li>
      <li><strong>Xbox Series</strong> — same as PS5; Series S is a bit softer</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      BG3 is mature now, so discounts are common. Humble frequently bundles or
      discounts the base game, and it's a good place to watch during seasonal sales.
      Compare against Steam / console-store promos before buying.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="humble"
          href="https://www.humblebundle.com/store?search=baldurs+gate+3"
          cta="Check Humble Bundle"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Baldurs+Gate+3"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
